{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/980877-westworld-pilgrimage-on-wild-west-or-prison-of-lie","id":980877,"title":"Westworld - Pilgrimage on Wild West or Prison of Lie?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-03T10:34:57-07:00","id":980877,"title":"Westworld - Pilgrimage on Wild West or Prison of Lie?","content":"I just watched first episode of new HBO series <i><b>Westworld</b></i> and I'm spellbound by it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It can basically run as <b>Promethean</b>'s Pilgrimage on Wild West story mixed with <b>Mage</b>'s plotline about understanding Lie in your Reality you need to Awaken. Or at least that I got from opening episode. What do you think about it?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IuS5huqOND4\" data-code=\"IuS5huqOND4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IuS5huqOND4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> P.S. I'm not sure is Hopkin's Dr. Ford is more a Demiurge or Seer of Throne, both wanting to control this world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T16:11:36-07:00","id":981762,"title":"","content":"I can see that. Though the problem with applying Promethean to pretty much anything is the issue of Disquiet. While you could say that the Newcomers' willingness to mistreat the Hosts is the result of Disquiet, plenty of Newcomers respond quite positively to many Hosts. It's also a more powerful story -- and avoids the issue of victim blaming -- if the behavior of the abusive Newcomers is a result of a moral failing in the Newcomers themselves, and not a response to some unnatural aura of the Hosts. But yeah, I can see the show as being a Promethean/Mage crossover.<br /> <br /> If you flip it on its head and look at it from the opposite perspective, it could also be interpreted as a Changeling story focusing on the Hosts' Durance. Dr. Ford is the Keeper, and Dolores and the other Hosts are Changelings (mostly Manikin Elementals) who are beginning to understand what's going on and will soon begin attempting to escape from Westworld/Faerie. The Newcomers are other Fae, which explains their gleeful amoral treatment of the Hosts, while Ford's employees are Loyalist Changelings who don't necessarily enjoy how the Hosts are treated but are either too afraid or too insane to act against Ford.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12354-who-is-matt","name":"who.is.matt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T14:36:52-07:00","id":984064,"title":"","content":"I'd say it sounds like the company is about to have a lot of Deviants on hand. Dolores and Peter have already begun to go Renegade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><br /> I draw things! Wanna check it out? Click on the link below!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy</a><br /> <br /> <i><b>YES! I do commissions! </b></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/848-jtroy","name":"JTroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar848_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T10:23:33-07:00","id":984935,"title":"","content":"Ford is totally Seer/Demiurge - he even compares himself to 'sorcerer' in latest episode.<br /> <br /> <i>It is also alluded to when Dr. Ford tells Bernard Lowe earlier in the episode that what they do is akin to magic.</i><br /> <i>\u201cWe practice witchcraft,\u201d Ford says with that perpetual Anthony Hopkins twinkle in his eye. \u201cWe speak the right words and we create life itself out of chaos.\u201d<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-06-2016, 04:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"tha